---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ENTITY_STATEMENT } from '../data/site.js';
---

<Base
  title="Writing"
  path="/writing"
  description={`${ENTITY_STATEMENT} Essays, posts, and podcast appearances on content security, fraud, and AI governance.`}
>
  <h1>Writing</h1>
  <p class="kicker">Where the longer thinking lives.</p>

  <h2>Your Ally on Substack</h2>
  <p>
    My newsletter is <a href="https://yourally.substack.com">Your Ally</a>. It's where the systems
    thinking gets room to breathe: content security, AI governance, and what it means to act with
    integrity toward the systems we're entangled with. Subscribe there for new essays.
  </p>

  <h2>LinkedIn</h2>
  <p>
    Shorter, more frequent pieces on deepfakes, fraud, and trust and safety live on
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/allymadrone">LinkedIn</a>. That's also where I share what
    I'm learning from the conference circuit.
  </p>

  <h2>Podcasts</h2>
  <p>
    I've guested on The Protectors (multiple episodes) and Digital Fortress talking AI-enabled
    fraud and content security. Episode links will land here as they publish.
  </p>

  <p>
    Want me to write for your publication or come on your show? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
